<title>GREECE: GREEK 1M ATHIBOR FALLS TO 11.73 FROM 11.76PCT.</title>
<headline>GREEK 1M ATHIBOR FALLS TO 11.73 FROM 11.76PCT.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens Interbank Offered Rate</p>
<p>(Athibor) for one month eased to 11.73 from 11.76 percent and</p>
<p>the bid rate (Athibid) slipped to 11.22 from 11.24 percent.</p>
<p>Monday was a market holiday.</p>
